      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI assistant for a Real Estate Agency.\n\nA potential client sent this email:\nFrom: {{ $json.fromName }}\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nMessage: {{ $json.body }}\n\nDo these 3 things:\n\n1. Detect query type from these options:\n   - Property Inquiry\n   - Budget Query\n   - Site Visit Request\n   - Location Query\n   - Documentation Query\n   - Negotiation\n   - General Query\n\n2. Detect priority:\n   - High (ready to buy, urgent, site visit)\n   - Medium (inquiring, comparing)\n   - Low (just browsing)\n\n3. Write a professional, warm real estate reply that:\n   - Addresses their specific query\n   - Mentions we have properties in their area\n   - Offers a site visit\n   - Keeps it under 150 words\n   - Signs off as \"Team [Agency Name]\"\n\nReturn ONLY this JSON:\n{\n  \"queryType\": \"detected type\",\n  \"priority\": \"high/medium/low\",\n  \"reply\": \"your generated reply\"\n}",
        "needsFallback": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
